.test-artifacts/

# Test and verification fixtures.
#
# These live inside the project directory rather than the system temp directory
# for a reason that is easy to mistake for carelessness: buildToolEnvironment
# refuses an agent home inside a protected host location, and the Windows temp
# directory is one. That refusal is correct — it is what stops an agent home from
# landing somewhere the operator does not control — so the fixtures moved instead
# of the guard being weakened. The consequence is that scratch directories appear
# here, and two of them were committed before this ignore list existed.
.probe*/
.bg-fixture-*/
.spill-fixture-*/
.verify-*/
.wt-*/
